[28.615068, "o", "\r\n"]
[28.615169, "o", "    \u001b[33m        data before giving up, as a float, or a :ref:`(connect timeout,\u001b[39;49;00m"]
[28.615241, "o", "\r\n"]
[28.615364, "o", "    \u001b[33m        read timeout) <timeouts>` tuple.\u001b[39;49;00m"]
